Begin "Going to Interface link"
	Open the sidemenu
	Click the "Control Panel" sidemenu entry
	Click the "Interface" charttab
	Click the "Inbound Demographics" link
	Verify exists "Your current permission of 'No' in the ('Control','Manage Inbound Demographics') security setting does not allow access to the Inbound Demographics editor." text
	Verify exists "A permission level of 'Yes' is required." text
	Verify exists "Please see your administrator with any questions." text
